      "writtenOn": "2026-04-13T19:46:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would again highlight something about how the performance works for these checks which might be obvious but I will restate.\n\nThe only time runtime checks should be avoided is in hot areas of the code. If we add tiny fractions of a % to add a bit of safety it is well worth it.",
